      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Hi! These questions are more targeted towards @Leo Moser (mole99) and @Andrew Wingate, but I'll try to answer to the best of my knowledge.\n1. The precheck should pass without problems I think.\n2. I hope that will be kept as it makes sense.\n3. We had a discussion with Leo about that. Experiments with the Run 1 testchip have shown that 3.3V is not enough to blow the fuses, so he decided to drop it.",
